{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Observations.L2_100x_SharedRoot","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x_SharedRoot","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.closure_paths_documented","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.closure_paths_documented","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L111-L111","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.closure_path_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.closure_path_count","kind":"def","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L107-L109","doc":"**Closure-path classification**: there are exactly 2 known\nresearch-grade paths to close the shared-root gap. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.l2_100x_shared_root_finding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.l2_100x_shared_root_finding","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L93-L105","doc":"**Structural finding** — verifies the audit's headline:\n3 of 7 observables miss the 100× target, and they share a\ncommon structural root (cluster in 159-181× band, i.e. within\n13% of each other in miss factor). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.miss_factor_band_width_le_30pct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.miss_factor_band_width_le_30pct","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L82-L91","doc":"**The 3 miss factors are within 30% of each other** (band width\n= 22; midpoint ≈ 170; relative spread = 22/170 ≈ 13%). The\ntight clustering is the quantitative signature of the shared\nstructural root. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.misses_share_band","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.misses_share_band","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L73-L80","doc":"**All 3 misses are in the same band [159, 181]** — verified by\ndirect comparison. This is the \"shared structural gap\" claim of\nthe audit: the failures cluster, they are not independent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.delta_pn_miss_factor_int","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.delta_pn_miss_factor_int","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.m_n_miss_factor_int","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.m_n_miss_factor_int","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.q_beta_miss_factor_int","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.q_beta_miss_factor_int","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L67-L69","doc":"**Miss-factor band** for the 3 failing observables, rounded to\nnearest integer. All three fall in [159, 181]. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.misses_count_eq_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.misses_count_eq_three","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L62-L65","doc":"The 3 failures account for the entire miss count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.misses_100x_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.misses_100x_count","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L59-L60","doc":"**Misses-100× count**. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.beats_100x_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.beats_100x_count","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L56-L57","doc":"**Beats-100× count** in the current dashboard. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.L2_100x.total_observables","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.L2_100x.total_observables","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/L2_100x_SharedRoot.lean#L52-L54","doc":"**Total observable count** in the L2 100× dashboard.\nEncoded as a verifiable Nat. ","signatureChunk":0}]}